@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 내 대표 말씀
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 대표 말씀 설정
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/profile/verse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":"KOR1910","bookCode":"JHN","chapter":13,"verse":34}

### 일요일 작성 알림
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/profile/reminder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled":true}

### 친구 닉네임 검색
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/friends/search?query=친절
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 친구 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/friends
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 친구 요청
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/friends/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"}

### 친구 요청 수락
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/friends/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 친구별 새 기도제목 알림
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/friends/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled":true}

### 친구 관계 해제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/friends/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 친구 차단
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/friends/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/block
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 친구 차단 해제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/friends/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/block
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 이번 주 기도제목 작성
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/topics/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"content":"이번 주 기도제목","visibleToFriends":true}

### 친구 기도제목
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/topics/feed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 내 기도제목
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/topics/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 특정 친구의 공개 기도제목
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/topics/friends/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 주간 발송권
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/quota
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 기도 편지 전송
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/topics/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003/letters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"content":"이번 주에도 함께 기도할게요."}

### 받은 편지
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/letters?box=RECEIVED
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 보낸 편지
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/letters?box=SENT
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 기도 알림
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 기도 알림 읽음
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/notifications/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 광고 보상 요청 (네이티브 AdMob SSV가 서버로 콜백한 후 발송권 증가)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prayer/reward-intents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"platform":"ANDROID"}
